add('ohos-certificate-fingerprint-pinning','Pin a certificate fingerprint on OH with a TLS socket probe','network',[],
 'If you need to compare a whole-certificate fingerprint, connect with a TLS socket and hash getRemoteCertificate, since http certificatePinning checks a public-key hash.',
 'Whole-certificate SHA-1 or SHA-256 pins never match when using the http module\'s certificatePinning option.',
 'OH network kit. A plugin write-up reports this behavior; no plugin source was reviewed. A separate probe connection does not guarantee that later requests reach the same server, so it is weaker than pinning on the real connection.',
 'certificate pinning|fingerprint|certificatePinning|constructTLSSocketInstance|getRemoteCertificate|createMd|GET_NETWORK_INFO|2300001|TLS',
 ['native-curl-explicit-ca-bundle','network-adapter-policy-propagation','oauth-browser-callback-correlation'],
 ['First see whether a public-key SHA-256 pin through http certificatePinning meets your need. Prefer that as it applies to the actual request.',
  'Otherwise resolve with connection.getAddressesByName, create socket.constructTLSSocketInstance, call bind before connect, and apply a timeout.',
  'Read getRemoteCertificate().data and hash it with cryptoFramework.createMd. Compare with the normalized expected value in constant format.',
  'Map errors separately: the source lists 2300001 for DNS, 2300003 for timeout and 2301001 to 2301006 for TLS failures. Close the socket every time.',
  'Declare ohos.permission.INTERNET and GET_NETWORK_INFO; the source reports Permission denied without the second.'],
 'Check before use and fail closed for security-relevant calls. Plan for certificate rotation by pinning more than one value.',
 'Treating a probe success as protection for later requests. Comparing formats with different case or separators. Failing open on DNS errors.',
 'Test matching and mismatching pins, an expired or rotated certificate, offline state, a timeout and a missing permission.',
 [('flutter-harmony-ebook',EC)],tier='imported-guidance',limitations=['Documentation with code excerpts; hash-only evidence. The probe weakness is a curator caution.'])
